        "description": "Authenticated users can change their avatar by uploading a new image.\r\n\r\nThe uploaded file must meet the following requirements:\r\n<ul><li>Maximum file size: 5 MB</li><li>Maximum dimensions: 500x500 pixels</li><li>Supported formats: JPEG, PNG, etc.</li></ul>\r\n<b>Note:</b> The `userId` parameter is required and should be provided as a query parameter (e.g., `?userId=...`).",
        "parameters": [
